WEBVTT

00:10.140 --> 00:13.940
Is this Amir Gaul?

00:16.950 --> 00:18.610
Your arm...

00:18.610 --> 00:20.320
Zed, what happened to your arm?

00:20.320 --> 00:25.120
I have no clue what the deal is.

00:33.960 --> 00:37.760
I've come all the way here at last, Hyrum.

00:38.500 --> 00:41.470
Move it, that's my place.

00:54.650 --> 01:02.260
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

01:02.260 --> 01:05.430
Utatte iru

01:05.430 --> 01:13.070
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

01:13.070 --> 01:16.340
Shimaikonde

01:16.340 --> 01:26.920
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:26.920 --> 01:32.350
Ayumou

01:32.350 --> 01:37.760
Susumou

01:37.760 --> 01:42.600
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:42.600 --> 01:48.070
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:48.070 --> 01:53.540
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:53.540 --> 01:58.780
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:58.780 --> 02:02.810
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

02:04.450 --> 02:07.980
Atashi wa ikite yuku

02:14.460 --> 02:18.130
Episode 38
Endless Battle

02:19.730 --> 02:23.140
Move it, that's my place.

02:23.140 --> 02:25.570
Where do you think this is?!

02:25.570 --> 02:28.540
There is no place for you in Neotopia!

02:29.910 --> 02:32.040
Can it, Hyrum.

02:33.520 --> 02:35.980
It's all over for you.

02:39.220 --> 02:41.020
Get him, Pronimo!

02:41.760 --> 02:43.380
Funam!

03:01.080 --> 03:04.350
Quit using such trifling spirits to resist me.

03:04.350 --> 03:06.310
It's a waste of time!

03:12.190 --> 03:13.980
This spirit is...

03:14.620 --> 03:16.250
Zico!

03:18.460 --> 03:21.160
I'm sorry I'm late.

03:21.160 --> 03:24.100
I'm all alone though.

03:24.100 --> 03:25.530
Zico!

03:25.530 --> 03:29.490
You see, unlike you,
I have a strong sense of obligation.

03:31.270 --> 03:33.840
The senile old fool from Templar, eh?

03:33.840 --> 03:36.810
Do you really think you can win against me?

03:39.110 --> 03:42.080
I never said I meant to fight you!

03:49.190 --> 03:51.160
Let's escape to the underground
passages while we can.

03:52.260 --> 03:53.890
Damn it...

04:09.010 --> 04:10.810
Is it Lady Diana?

04:11.550 --> 04:12.910
Noah...

04:12.910 --> 04:14.780
Noah, are you safe?

04:14.780 --> 04:16.350
Lady Diana!

04:16.350 --> 04:18.590
Kira and I are both fine.

04:18.590 --> 04:20.260
More importantly, what about the castle?

04:20.260 --> 04:24.530
I regret to say the castle has fallen
into the enemy's hands.

04:24.530 --> 04:26.130
No!

04:26.130 --> 04:27.530
What of Holy Father Hyrum?

04:27.530 --> 04:29.830
He is safe.

04:30.430 --> 04:31.100
Noah?

04:31.100 --> 04:32.200
Yes, ma'am!
Noah?

04:32.200 --> 04:37.070
We are in the underground passageways,
making for the Stupa.

04:37.070 --> 04:38.370
Underground passageways?

04:38.370 --> 04:40.980
The enemy could overtake us any moment.

04:40.980 --> 04:42.510
Join us, quickly!

04:42.510 --> 04:44.080
Understood!

04:44.080 --> 04:46.010
Kira, to the underground passages!

04:46.010 --> 04:47.810
Got it!

04:51.320 --> 04:53.760
What do you plan to do now?

04:53.760 --> 04:56.420
The castle may have fallen to the enemy,

04:56.420 --> 04:59.260
but that does not mean Neotopia has fallen.

04:59.260 --> 05:01.260
As long as I am alive,

05:01.260 --> 05:05.530
in the name of Absolute Justice,
Neotopia will be rebuilt.

05:05.530 --> 05:07.660
There are still options left to us.

05:09.140 --> 05:14.340
But Zico, I never thought you would
come here yourself.

05:14.340 --> 05:16.410
I thank you once again.

05:16.410 --> 05:20.150
Templar is still watching and waiting.

05:20.150 --> 05:23.250
Unable to even provide proper
reinforcements as your ally...

05:23.250 --> 05:25.720
I feel guilty about it, honestly.

05:35.060 --> 05:36.830
Is that Zico's dinner?

05:36.830 --> 05:38.330
I'll deliver it.

05:38.330 --> 05:40.270
Yes, sir, but...

05:40.270 --> 05:44.170
Don't worry, I'm used to babysitting the Elder.

05:44.170 --> 05:47.140
Then, I'll leave it to you with thanks, sir.

05:56.480 --> 05:59.610
They're feeding him this nasty bread?

06:10.000 --> 06:11.900
Prepare to die, Hyrum!

06:11.900 --> 06:16.440
Once you're out of the picture,
this country will be completely ours!

06:16.440 --> 06:20.040
Your Holiness, please take Master Zico
and go on ahead!

06:20.040 --> 06:21.670
Funam!

06:22.910 --> 06:25.540
You go on, Hyrum!

06:54.740 --> 06:56.370
Your Holiness!

07:00.450 --> 07:02.080
Sachura!

07:02.850 --> 07:05.950
Your Holiness, my deepest apologies
for coming so late.

07:05.950 --> 07:06.950
Noah!

07:06.950 --> 07:07.790
Noah!

07:07.790 --> 07:11.590
Lady Diana, leave this to us and take
His Holiness to a safe place!

07:12.560 --> 07:13.560
Boy!

07:13.560 --> 07:15.960
I didn't think you'd be here, old man.

07:15.960 --> 07:20.420
Well, I was worried you might be overdoing it,
here by yourself.

07:21.770 --> 07:25.230
As you can see,
I couldn't overdo it now even if I wanted to.

07:27.580 --> 07:29.410
Master Zico!

07:29.410 --> 07:33.710
Oh, Roya, looks like you're safe.

07:37.150 --> 07:38.780
Sachura!

07:54.700 --> 07:56.500
Why, you!

08:04.050 --> 08:07.450
We're almost there, the Stupa isn't far.

08:07.450 --> 08:10.080
Come, let's go.

08:13.690 --> 08:15.490
That's ...

08:15.490 --> 08:17.890
I have a little sister,

08:17.890 --> 08:20.860
whom I was separated from
when I was exiled from Neotopia.

08:21.260 --> 08:22.960
Little sister?

08:22.960 --> 08:26.920
My sister has a birthmark just like mine.

08:36.240 --> 08:38.210
Master Zico!

08:38.210 --> 08:40.010
Are you all right?

08:41.980 --> 08:45.250
Looks like I was a bit too over-enthusiastic
for a man of my age.

08:45.250 --> 08:47.460
Maybe you should rest a while.

08:47.460 --> 08:50.660
No, I'll be fine, Roya.

08:50.660 --> 08:53.460
So, shall we go?

09:01.700 --> 09:04.440
Where's Hyrum?

09:04.440 --> 09:08.340
The insolent boy and the
unsociable brat interfered.

09:08.340 --> 09:10.240
What?

09:10.240 --> 09:12.380
So, Nudyu screwed up.

09:12.380 --> 09:15.580
It looks like they're headed for that " Stupa" thing.

09:15.580 --> 09:17.650
The Stupa, eh?

09:17.650 --> 09:19.450
What rubbish...

09:22.120 --> 09:24.920
So, this is the Neotopian king's throne?

09:25.560 --> 09:29.020
Move it, Hugh, that's my place.

09:30.430 --> 09:33.400
This is no place for a puppet king to sit.

09:33.400 --> 09:35.200
What?!

09:36.640 --> 09:40.070
If I'm a puppet, you're no better!

09:40.070 --> 09:42.780
Now that Amir Gaul has rejected you,

09:42.780 --> 09:47.740
you're nothing but a sacrificial pawn
to Master Xeem!

10:05.230 --> 10:10.190
Hanging out with an idiotic beastman king
is a waste of time.

10:11.010 --> 10:12.800
Let's go, Elmeida.

10:16.840 --> 10:20.250
We've brought all the surviving
soldiers underground.

10:20.250 --> 10:23.150
About ninety percent of them are injured,

10:23.150 --> 10:26.290
and I can't imagine that they'd
be of any use in a battle.

10:26.290 --> 10:28.320
What will you do, Hyrum?

10:28.320 --> 10:31.130
You have no chance of winning now, you know.

10:31.130 --> 10:34.830
Let's at least evacuate the survivors to Templar.

10:34.830 --> 10:36.730
We'll start with the injured.

10:36.730 --> 10:38.400
Out of the question!

10:38.400 --> 10:39.530
What?

10:39.530 --> 10:41.830
Neotopia will never fall!

10:42.740 --> 10:44.910
How can you be so sure?

10:44.910 --> 10:49.110
It's not that I don't understand
the regret you feel,

10:49.110 --> 10:52.310
but at this rate the body count
will just keep growing!

10:52.310 --> 10:54.940
This is not over yet!

10:55.620 --> 11:00.580
The key spirit Monadi is sleeping
beneath our feet.

11:01.560 --> 11:03.420
A key spirit?

11:03.420 --> 11:05.050
Monadi?

11:12.670 --> 11:14.970
You still can't find it?

11:14.970 --> 11:17.070
We've put all our efforts into the search,

11:17.070 --> 11:18.570
but we've found nothing yet.

11:18.570 --> 11:20.410
We have no time.

11:20.410 --> 11:24.050
Please, find the key spirit as soon as you can.

11:24.050 --> 11:25.670
Yes, ma'am!

11:26.350 --> 11:31.620
This Stupa is a symbol of my ideal,
Absolute Justice.

11:31.620 --> 11:34.090
And the reason I chose this location

11:34.090 --> 11:38.460
is because this is a holy place
where a key spirit sleeps!

11:38.460 --> 11:40.760
I trust that's the truth?

11:41.460 --> 11:44.970
I've investigated thoroughly,
and it's been firmly established.

11:44.970 --> 11:48.100
A key spirit, here...

11:48.100 --> 11:54.410
If we obtain the key spirit,
Noah can become an even stronger savior.

11:55.710 --> 11:58.840
Without a doubt, this country will be saved.

12:01.920 --> 12:07.960
Noah, you have already saved my life twice.

12:07.960 --> 12:11.580
Now, I ask you to save Neotopia.

12:12.330 --> 12:14.330
Save Neotopia...

12:14.330 --> 12:16.330
I know you can.

12:16.330 --> 12:22.300
Without a doubt, you can save this
country and all its people!

12:22.300 --> 12:26.430
And that is the savior's fate!

12:27.340 --> 12:31.300
The savior's fate...

12:40.350 --> 12:45.230
We are putting all our efforts into the dig,
but we have found nothing yet.

12:45.230 --> 12:47.020
I see...

12:47.730 --> 12:51.690
What will happen to us now?

12:52.200 --> 12:54.170
Are you scared?

12:55.100 --> 12:58.730
It's okay, I'll protect you, Sagiri.

12:59.310 --> 13:03.270
But Noah, you're the savior, right?

13:05.280 --> 13:09.740
It's your job to protect Holy Father Hyrum
and Neotopia, right?

13:12.820 --> 13:16.780
I wonder what's happened to your arm?

13:17.490 --> 13:18.860
I don't know,

13:18.860 --> 13:23.530
but I can't feel my spirits' power at all,

13:23.530 --> 13:25.530
not even Rambos's .

13:25.530 --> 13:28.000
No need to worry.

13:28.670 --> 13:32.570
Amir Gaul is asleep.

13:32.570 --> 13:35.210
You'll just have to wait until he awakens.

13:35.210 --> 13:38.010
But he's already awakened once!

13:38.010 --> 13:40.110
He turned into a bird-like thing.

13:40.110 --> 13:43.880
He probably hasn't completely awakened yet.

13:43.880 --> 13:48.340
and your left arm is just resting until then.

13:48.920 --> 13:50.550
Resting...

13:51.960 --> 13:52.390
Old man!

13:52.390 --> 13:53.390
Master Zico!
Old man!

13:53.390 --> 13:54.630
Master Zico!

13:54.630 --> 13:56.130
Are you okay, old man?!

13:56.130 --> 13:57.760
Master Zico!

14:16.650 --> 14:18.280
Your Holiness!

14:18.790 --> 14:22.360
Please give me permission to heal Master Zico!

14:22.360 --> 14:23.820
What?

14:23.820 --> 14:26.830
Master Zico has collapsed from exhaustion,

14:26.830 --> 14:29.860
and I want to heal him with my shard magic!

14:29.860 --> 14:33.660
After properly getting permission
from you this time.

14:35.040 --> 14:38.370
Very well, I'll allow it.

14:38.370 --> 14:40.340
Thank you very much.

14:50.950 --> 14:52.350
What's wrong?

14:52.350 --> 14:55.190
Feeling troubled again?

14:55.190 --> 14:57.490
Protect Holy Father Hyrum...

14:57.490 --> 14:59.860
Protect Sagiri...

14:59.860 --> 15:02.830
Protect all of the people of Neotopia...

15:03.900 --> 15:09.270
It's just impossible for me to
protect everyone all alone!

15:09.270 --> 15:12.070
You're not alone, Noah.

15:13.170 --> 15:16.440
If that is your fate as the savior,

15:16.440 --> 15:21.400
then it is our duty to support and aid you.

15:21.920 --> 15:24.710
That's what I think.

15:28.020 --> 15:30.490
Listen up, Hyrum!

15:38.300 --> 15:42.600
Neotopia's capital has fallen to us!

15:42.600 --> 15:48.410
All I want now is your head, Hyrum!

15:50.610 --> 15:52.850
That bastard...

15:52.850 --> 15:54.810
Take a look at this!

16:01.860 --> 16:05.480
These are the surviving Neotopian civilians!

16:08.130 --> 16:09.600
Elmeida...

16:09.600 --> 16:11.390
Do it!

16:19.210 --> 16:20.210
That's cruel!

16:20.210 --> 16:22.000
How could you?!

16:24.910 --> 16:30.420
If you want to save any hostages,
bring me Hyrum's head.

16:30.420 --> 16:33.880
If you don't hurry up, they'll all die.

16:39.830 --> 16:43.530
If we don't do something, more hostages
will just be mercilessly slaughtered!

16:43.530 --> 16:48.840
But to give them Holy Father Hyrum
would be tantamount to surrender!

16:48.840 --> 16:50.640
And even if we do surrender now,

16:50.640 --> 16:54.770
there's no guarantee that Hugh will let us live!

16:55.540 --> 17:00.910
Your Holiness, I think letting them lay
down their lives for Absolute Law

17:00.910 --> 17:02.420
would make the hostages happier.

17:02.420 --> 17:03.080
But...

17:03.080 --> 17:05.050
You may be right.
But...

17:05.420 --> 17:07.990
Rather than dying at the hands of the enemy,

17:07.990 --> 17:13.590
it would be happier for them to die at our hands

17:13.590 --> 17:16.560
in the name of Absolute Justice.

17:16.560 --> 17:19.570
They haven't broken the law!

17:19.570 --> 17:23.240
They were captured by the enemy
and became hostages.

17:23.240 --> 17:28.540
Are you sure that, in and of itself, isn't
a violation of Absolute Law?

17:28.540 --> 17:32.000
If it were me,
I'd have committed suicide instead.

17:32.450 --> 17:37.150
Noah, Absolute Law must not be disrupted.

17:37.150 --> 17:41.610
That would spell the ruin of this country.

17:59.070 --> 18:03.680
Master Genm, we have pinpointed
Lady Sagiri's location.

18:03.680 --> 18:06.950
I see, good work.

18:06.950 --> 18:13.250
I'm sorry to send you out so quickly,
but I leave Sagiri to you, Sara.

18:17.360 --> 18:21.460
Hostages will be killed while
we're still standing here!

18:21.460 --> 18:22.860
I know...

18:22.860 --> 18:25.660
How long are they going to talk?!

18:26.800 --> 18:28.370
Noah...

18:28.370 --> 18:29.800
Noah!

18:29.800 --> 18:32.910
Well? Is there a decision, or what?!

18:32.910 --> 18:36.540
I'm the savior.

18:37.580 --> 18:42.480
I have to save this country, and all its people.

18:42.480 --> 18:44.220
What's wrong with you, Noah?!

18:44.220 --> 18:46.250
What about the hostages?!

18:46.250 --> 18:48.720
In the name of Absolute Justice,

18:48.720 --> 18:53.520
I'm going to let them die at my hands!

18:55.800 --> 18:57.560
That's the right thing, isn't it?

18:57.560 --> 19:00.470
That's what Absolute Law says, right?

19:00.470 --> 19:03.200
That's my fate, right?!

19:03.200 --> 19:04.740
Tell me, Zed!

19:04.740 --> 19:06.340
Tell me this is right!

19:06.340 --> 19:08.440
Zed! Zed!

19:08.440 --> 19:11.900
Well, shall we start Round Two?

19:20.150 --> 19:23.060
Hurry and send reinforcements...

19:23.060 --> 19:24.680
Master Zico...

19:28.930 --> 19:31.300
I told you, didn't I, Noah?

19:31.300 --> 19:34.100
Absolute Law is wrong.

19:48.280 --> 19:50.080
What do you want?

19:50.520 --> 19:54.020
Hyrum, you're coming with me!

19:54.020 --> 19:55.650
What?

20:01.090 --> 20:04.330
A lot of people have lost their lives,
or are suffering right now,

20:04.330 --> 20:07.300
and it's all because of you!

20:08.640 --> 20:10.900
Come fight Hugh with me!

20:10.900 --> 20:13.370
Stop, Zed!

20:13.370 --> 20:16.410
Holy Father Hyrum is Absolute Justice itself.

20:16.410 --> 20:18.750
If we lost him,

20:18.750 --> 20:21.750
Neotopia would be no more!

20:21.750 --> 20:23.450
Shut up, Noah!

20:23.450 --> 20:25.290
You just keep quiet!

20:25.290 --> 20:28.410
Hyrum, I'm taking you with me
whether you like it or not!

20:36.200 --> 20:37.830
Noah?

20:37.830 --> 20:39.460
You...

20:42.440 --> 20:43.840
Diana!

20:43.840 --> 20:46.310
You failed to protect your country.

20:46.310 --> 20:48.940
You have lost the right to be king.

20:48.940 --> 20:54.900
I shall protect true Absolute Justice,
along with our savior Noah.

20:55.780 --> 21:00.080
You misunderstood the meaning of the savior!

21:08.160 --> 21:11.100
No response, eh?

21:11.100 --> 21:12.970
How boring...

21:12.970 --> 21:15.600
Elmeida, finish them all off.

21:15.600 --> 21:17.370
Sure!

21:17.370 --> 21:19.340
Kill all the hostages!

21:19.610 --> 21:21.230
Wait!

21:35.160 --> 21:37.780
So, they've finally made a move.

21:44.160 --> 21:47.290
I've brought Hyrum to you, just like you asked!

21:48.140 --> 21:49.840
That brat!

21:49.840 --> 21:50.940
Holy Father Hyrum!

21:50.940 --> 21:52.730
What's going on here?!

21:55.540 --> 21:59.710
I wouldn't have guessed that you
would drag Hyrum out to me.

21:59.710 --> 22:03.480
Have you decided to become one of us?

22:03.480 --> 22:07.780
I don't have time to listen to your lame jokes.

22:11.590 --> 22:15.550
Now, let go of the hostages like you promised.

22:17.200 --> 22:19.000
Oh, Hyrum...

22:19.000 --> 22:23.940
Your castle's been taken,
and even your comrades have betrayed you.

22:23.940 --> 22:27.070
You can't get any more pathetic than this.

22:44.830 --> 22:49.600
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

22:49.600 --> 22:53.630
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

22:53.630 --> 22:57.200
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

22:57.200 --> 23:03.540
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:03.540 --> 23:08.420
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

23:08.420 --> 23:12.090
My old days kawarazu sawagu weekend

23:12.090 --> 23:15.920
Tada tanoshikute muchi de rikutsunuki de

23:15.920 --> 23:19.790
Grateful days matatakuma no tsukihi de

23:19.790 --> 23:24.060
Mina ano hi kara hanare sorezore mezashiteru

23:24.060 --> 23:26.730
Otona ni natte omoide wa mune te o futte

23:26.730 --> 23:27.900
Mukau saki o mitsume

23:27.900 --> 23:31.540
Tatakatteru sugata omotte makenai otagai mae ni

23:31.540 --> 23:33.640
Soba ni inakute mo kamawanai

23:33.640 --> 23:35.610
Egao mitakute mo ima ja nai

23:35.610 --> 23:37.610
Furikaeru hodo " ltsuka miseru" to

23:37.610 --> 23:39.880
ltsumade mo kawaranai

23:40.450 --> 23:45.250
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

23:45.250 --> 23:49.320
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

23:49.320 --> 23:52.930
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

23:52.930 --> 23:59.270
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:59.270 --> 24:04.970
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

24:18.150 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Epiphany

24:18.720 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Epiphany"
